    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/b6f87ea9855ebf62f9dc0889ca4e5dd2.avif?t=1754824055\" width=598 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barbara: Sex Story is an adult visual novel that dives deep into the world of fashion, glamour, and\u2026 forbidden desires. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the lavish <strong>Pink Star</strong> fashion house villa\u2014where stunning models, elite designers, and industry moguls come together for the biggest runway event of the year. But behind the dazzling lights and couture gowns, secrets lurk in the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/df4d197137ce520b9d9f74d6f38ec6d6.poster.avif?t=1754824055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/df4d197137ce520b9d9f74d6f38ec6d6.webm?t=1754824055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/df4d197137ce520b9d9f74d6f38ec6d6.mp4?t=1754824055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts as a grand spectacle. Edward Gold, the mastermind behind the event, gathers top models, couturiers, and staff for a few days of intense preparations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/b45f45e911ec1d2cd4bfeab9d02268d0.avif?t=1754824055\" width=598 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything seems to be going according to plan\u2026 until Edward is found dead just three days before the show. Suddenly, the glamorous world of high fashion turns into a tangled web of lies, seduction, and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/d6eb0b5ecdb1424cdb48ed873bc34a59.poster.avif?t=1754824055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/d6eb0b5ecdb1424cdb48ed873bc34a59.webm?t=1754824055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/d6eb0b5ecdb1424cdb48ed873bc34a59.mp4?t=1754824055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six models, two designers, and a team of professionals must keep the show on track\u2014while navigating shocking twists, hidden rivalries, and\u2026 irresistible temptations. Interior designers work their magic, waitstaff keeps the champagne flowing, and the butler does his best to maintain order (and satisfy the models' demands).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/733db7da61e577622cc569f4a89863b4.avif?t=1754824055\" width=598 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With time running out and passions rising, the truth behind Edward\u2019s murder slowly unravels. Can you uncover the killer while indulging in the guilty pleasures of the fashion elite? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/extras/794fb8e5ff42ef4de0ee225c48188e3c.poster.avif?t=1754824055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658650/